  m_Name: PoweredArmorSquad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Powered Armor Squad
  role: 3
  description: 'Five soldiers in powered armor with Assault Rifles. Armor Level 2
    halves rifle damage and shrugs off pistols and grenades entirely, so the squad
    can walk through fire that would shred an Infantry Squad; the Sergeant has 10
    health, the Troopers 5. The trade-off is speed: only 6 m a move (12 m sprinting),
    so start advancing early or put them where the fight will come to them. A Specialist:
    one per army.'
